# TEagle repository exclusions
# Local tool and editor metadata
**/.claude/
**/AGENTS.md
**/CLAUDE.md
**/GEMINI.md
**/.agents/
**/.codex/
**/scratchpad/
*.session.json
.vs/
*.user
*.suo

# Local analysis, review, and verification workspaces
outdated/
manuscript/
Deliverables/
report/
review-records/
verification/
scratch_e2e/
/workflows/
DESIGN-IS-*/

# Build / packaging artifacts (regenerable; the shippable installer is attached to a Release)
dist/
dist_native/
build/
build_native/
*.pyi_manifest
/installer/_version_info.txt

# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
venv/
.pytest_cache/
.pytest_tmp*/

# Node / legacy web tooling
node_modules/
.cache/

# Runtime state + logs + temp
.teagle/
*.log
*.tmp

# Unused sample sequences (the app generates its demo element in code)
app/samples/

# Scientific databases & large binaries (user-installed at runtime, never committed)
databases/
models/
*.h5
*.2bit
*.nhr
*.nin
*.nsq
*.sam
# loose sequence scratch at the repo root (fixtures under tests/ are re-included below)
/*.fa
/*.fasta
/*.fna
/*.gz

# OS cruft
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
.DS_Store

# Keep the assets the tool and its tests need
!tests/fixtures/
!tests/fixtures/*.fasta
!app/backend/data/
!app/backend/data/*.hmm

# Regenerable benchmark inputs and per-case outputs
benchmarks/raw/genbank/
benchmarks/raw/teagle/
benchmarks/raw/tesorter/
benchmarks/raw/assay/
benchmarks/raw/teagle_holdout/
benchmarks/outdated/
*.json.bak
# Corpus-assembly intermediate
benchmarks/raw/corpus_holdout_raw.json
